ed tile interior supplies the output background color.\n    fill = max(set(v for row in grid for v in row),\n               key=lambda v: sum(row.count(v) for row in grid))\n    separator = grid[0][0]\n\n    out = []\n    for r in range(nr):\n        row = []\n        for c in range(nc):\n            v = grid[r * rh][c * cw]\n            row.append(fill if v == separator else v)\n        out.append(row)\n    return out\n```\n{\"action\":\"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit","correct":false,"valid":false}},{"step":66,"kind":"observation","phase":"act","t0":1793589989.838,"t1":1793590008.028,"alias":"task-4bcb43b3","message":"Feedback since your last action:\nYour submission was INCORRECT (the grid was not a valid ARC grid). Wrong attempts so far: 3.\n\nSame instance. Task id: task-4bcb43b3\nTest input (29x25):\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 5 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 5 3 3\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n5 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 5 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 5 3 3\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n5 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 5 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 4 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 4 3 3\n3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 3 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 